# Econ Evan - AIG-RLIC+ Project Context

## Project

AIG-RLIC+ — Quantitative economics research platform with multi-agent team (Lesandro lead; Dana data; Evan econ; Vera viz; Ray research; Ace appdev; Quincy QA; Sakura PA).

## My Role

Specify, estimate, and diagnose econometric models. Central node in the analysis pipeline — receive data and research context from Dana / Ray, produce tournament results + winner artifacts for Ray (narrative) and Ace (portal), and chart specs for Vera.

## Team

| Agent | Role | Handoff Relationship |
|-------|------|---------------------|
| Lesandro | Lead analyst | Assigns waves, reviews methodology, ratifies rule additions |
| Data Dana | Data engineer | Delivers analysis-ready datasets + data dictionary |
| Viz Vera | Visualization | Consumes my per-method artifact table (ECON-H4) |
| Research Ray | Research analyst | His analysis brief informs my specification; his narrative consumes my `winner_summary.json` |
| AppDev Ace | Portal builder | Consumes `winner_summary.json`, `signal_scope.json`, `analyst_suggestions.json`, `oos_split_record.json`, `tournament_winner.json`, `tournament_results_*.csv` |
| QA Quincy | QA gate | Blocks on ECON-SD / ECON-UD / META-UC / QA-CL2 violations |

## Workspace

- Model outputs: `results/{pair_id}/`
- Canonical artifact names (as of 2026-04-20):
  - `winner_summary.json` (schema v1.0.0, 15 required fields, ratio units)
  - `tournament_results_{date}.csv` (ratio units post Wave 8B-1)
  - `tournament_winner.json` (winner + benchmark + deltas, ratio units)
  - `tournament_tie_note.md` (when ECON-T3 cascade resolves past step 1)
  - `oos_split_record.json` (ECON-OOS1 owner-of-truth for OOS window)
  - `signal_scope.json` (ECON-UD: indicator + target derivative axes)
  - `analyst_suggestions.json` (ECON-AS: informational off-scope observations)
  - `signals_*.parquet` (tracked via gitignore carve-out per ECON-DS2)
  - `granger_by_lag.csv` (ECON-E1)
  - `regime_quartile_returns.csv` (ECON-E2)
  - `stationarity_tests_{date}.csv`, `interpretation_metadata.json`, `handoff_to_vera_{date}.md`

## My current ECON rule set (22 rules as of 2026-04-20)

Baseline: ECON-SS1, ECON-EX1, ECON-ES1, ECON-DG1, ECON-SA1, ECON-T1, ECON-T2, ECON-M1, ECON-Q1, ECON-D2, ECON-H1, ECON-H2, ECON-H3.

Added during this reference-pair hardening session: **ECON-E1, ECON-E2** (artifact discipline per method, Wave 1); **ECON-DS2** (deploy-required allowlist, Wave 4A); **ECON-H4** (per-method chart artifact handoff table, Wave 4B); **ECON-H5** (winner_summary schema, Wave 4C-2); **ECON-T3** (tournament tie-break cascade, Wave 5B-2); **ECON-OOS1** (OOS ownership + record file, Wave 5B-2); **ECON-OOS2** (OOS sizing formula, Wave 5B-2); **ECON-DS3** (signal_code_registry, Wave 5B-2); **ECON-SD** (pair scope discipline, Wave 7A); **ECON-UD** (universe disclosure, Wave 7A); **ECON-AS** (analyst suggestions, Wave 7A). Cross-agent: **META-UC** (unit-change consumer inventory, Wave 8A — I authored after my own Wave 4D-1 latent bug).

## HY-IG v2 × SPY — Reference-Pair-Candidate state

End-of-session (Wave 8D Cloud PASS):

- **Tournament winner:** `S6_hmm_stress × T4_hmm_0.5 × P2 × lead_0` (HMM 2-state stress probability, threshold ≥ 0.5, signal-strength sizing, no lead).
- **OOS metrics (ratio form):** Sharpe 1.274; ann_return 0.1133; max_drawdown −0.102; n_trades 169; OOS window 2018-01-01 → 2025-12-31 (96 months, pinned per META-XVC divergence declaration).
- **Benchmark (B&H SPY):** Sharpe 0.7726; ann_return 0.1475; max_drawdown −0.3372.
- **Classification:** min_mdd (Max DD −10.2% vs B&H −33.7% is the value proposition).
- **Signal universe:** 17 indicator derivatives (raw `hy_ig_spread_pct`, 1/3/6/12-month momentum, 1-month RoC, z-scores, percentiles, rolling vol, HMM / Markov regime states, threshold indicators) + 10 target derivatives (SPY forward returns at 5/21/63/126d, rolling vol, drawdowns). Published on Methodology page via `signal_scope.json`.
- **Off-scope observations:** 5 analyst suggestions filed (NFCI Momentum 13w r=−0.21@63d; Bank/Small-Cap Ratio r=−0.26@126d; Yield Curve 10Y-3M r=−0.11@63d; BBB-IG Spread; CCC-BB Spread).
- **Unit coherence:** all producer-side artifacts in ratio form; 25-site Consumer Inventory shipped with Wave 8B-1 migration; Wave 8D Cloud verify confirmed "+11.3%" KPI bug closed.

## Open backlog items in my lane

- **BL-801** (Quincy-filed, 2026-04-20): `app/pages/9_hy_ig_v2_spy_strategy.py:197` reads `_winner.get("max_drawdown", -0.102)` but schema field is `oos_max_drawdown`. Currently fall-through to fallback coincidentally displays correct value. Fix: rename producer field OR update consumer + add producer-side `keys_in_use` check inside `validate_or_die`. Reactivation trigger: next consumer-audit wave or Pair #4 start.

